  "interpretation": [
    "The paper coordinates translate to complete proteins of reported lengths, including restored 826-aa FruB.",
    "Q9RZP7 and Q9RZP6 exactly match the complete FruA and FruK translations despite historical strain-label ambiguity.",
    "Table S2 names KDR_B0074 tagatose-6-phosphate kinase but Table S3 names its counterparts 1-phosphofructokinase; naming disagreement is not substrate assay evidence.",
    "No UniProt accession is assigned to restored FruB: targeted current searches did not establish one.",
    "Restored ORF and intact locus do not demonstrate PEP-driven uptake in ATCC13939K. The older ATP-dependent fraction assays cannot be generalized to every strain."
